  "wave49Text": "INVADERS\n31\nMOVEMENT\nGround\nHP EACH\n117,958\nARMOR\n48\nTILES / SECOND\n2.05\nAbilities\nShell blocks 200 damage per direct hit, including Holy damage\nRestores 25% missing health every 4s · healing block prevents recharge\nLore and guidance\n\nThe guardians of the deep maw have left the approaches to Bernhard’s seat for the first time in living memory. They are the last oath-bound barrier before their master; if the kingdom can stand against them, it will have forced the architect of the invasion to answer in person.\n\nDeep shell · Soul recharge\n\nReduces damage from individual direct hits. Periodically restores health. Armor reduces all three damage types; use armor reduction or penetration.",
